  "description": "Doo-San and Tae-San were inseparable as teens, just two boys, side-by-side at their favorite arcade. Now reunited as adults, nothing’s changed…and yet everything has. Their bond is as tight as ever, but lately, the air between them crackles with something more. Doo-San can’t stop overthinking every glance, every brush of skin, every heartbeat. Just when he thinks he can keep burying those feelings, someone new shows up, ready to drive a wedge right through whatever’s been building between them. Unless Doo-San can work up the courage to face his own feelings, that is...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
